  "_details_alignment": "center",
  "details": "We're thrilled to announce our new {{badge:new}} Real-Time Announcements System is now live across the platform! This powerful communication tool delivers {{badge:critical}} updates instantly with priority-based notifications ({{icon:alert}} Critical, {{icon:warning}} Important, {{icon:info}} Info), ensuring your team stays informed when it matters most.\n\nThe system features a smart notification bell with {{badge:success}} unread count badges, expandable announcement cards with {{percent:100}} visibility, and automatic time-stamped entries showing {{date:2025-11-16}}. Users can mark announcements as read, filter by priority, and access the full history - all from a beautiful, non-intrusive interface that blends seamlessly into both the Main App and CMS Admin.\n\nWith {{short:3}} active announcements currently displaying on your dashboard, you're already experiencing the future of internal communication. Say goodbye to missed updates and hello to {{badge:connected}} team-wide awareness!",
